A major point of contention between the world's second and third largest nuclear powers appears to be resolved.

01:09:25.050 --> 01:09:28.450
Ukraine agreed Friday to give Russia all of its nuclear warheads.

01:09:28.870 --> 01:09:29.970
In return, Ukraine...

01:09:30.000 --> 01:09:35.300
gets its debts forgiven. Part of the deal includes returning the Black Sea fleet to Russia as well.

01:09:35.540 --> 01:09:40.340
Bob Abernathy has a report on the accord that could bring a great sigh of relief to a world

01:09:40.340 --> 01:09:47.590
rife with nuclear weapons. It was a stunning concession. After months of refusing to give

01:09:47.590 --> 01:09:53.290
up his nuclear weapons, Ukraine's President Kravchuk gave in to Russia's President Yeltsin

01:09:53.290 --> 01:09:59.970
and agreed to turn over to Russia for dismantling all Ukraine's nuclear warheads, which Russia would

01:10:00.000 --> 01:10:06.980
dismantle. Also, Ukraine will sell Russia its half of the Black Sea fleet. Russia gets security

01:10:06.980 --> 01:10:14.480
and Ukraine reduces its debt. I think it will help Russia strategically, it will help Ukraine

01:10:14.480 --> 01:10:19.590
economically, and it will promote American national security. The collapse of the Soviet

01:10:19.590 --> 01:10:25.810
Union left Ukraine with 1,900 nuclear warheads and bombs, more than any country in the world

01:10:25.810 --> 01:10:29.900
except the U.S. and Russia. Even with the Cold War over, Ukraine...

01:10:30.000 --> 01:10:32.560
Ukraine's missiles were still targeted at the U.S.

01:10:34.650 --> 01:10:38.870
Proud Ukrainian nationalists had fought to hold on to their nuclear weapons,

01:10:39.010 --> 01:10:42.090
or at least use them as bargaining chips for Western aid.

01:10:43.760 --> 01:10:46.100
But Ukraine's economy is in collapse.

01:10:46.420 --> 01:10:52.300
Hundreds of thousands of miners went on strike in June to protest 40% a month inflation.

01:10:54.280 --> 01:10:57.980
So, dependent on Russia for almost all its oil and gas,

01:10:58.220 --> 01:10:59.980
and with a huge unpaid debt to...

01:11:00.000 --> 01:11:06.350
russia ukraine apparently had to make a deal parliaments in both countries have to ratify

01:11:06.350 --> 01:11:12.510
today's agreement and ukrainian nationalists are expected to protest but if the deal stands it will

01:11:12.510 --> 01:11:19.910
